{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-09_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-09","title":"旧日之影","storyCode":"10-10","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1b513dc1dedafe4f2ce5013b396777f20b04b3421b61c333f4ca3ab968aad57a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，大家这边走！跟着火光，穿过这些烟雾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这是什么东西？某种搅拌器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是觉得这种滑稽的工具能伤到一个萨卡兹雇佣兵吗......伦蒂尼姆的小猫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别、别过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用紧张。过来吧，到我身后来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位雇佣兵......虽然看起来不像好人，但她暂时站在我们这一边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同一边吗？你最好还是怀疑怀疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W......假如你真想从我这里得到任何消息，那么你最好把自己变得更容易合作一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么也喜欢把威胁的话说得这么弯弯绕绕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......你不会是凯尔希的私生女吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，仔细看了看，一点都不像。而且那个冷淡的老女人怎么可能会有后代？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了算了，我对你们这类人真是喜欢不起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚好，我今晚也没打算再多交一个朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么别担心，我不会在这里久待。我知道自己的脑袋在其他雇佣兵眼里有多值钱，所以完全不打算做慈善。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炸弹......你果然还埋了更多炸弹。你这是......炸了从其他入口过来的路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的同伴呢？他们不还在园区深处跟萨卡兹士兵们作战吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真好奇我的回答？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解释前因后果很费时间，我可以告诉你结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——他们都死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为把你捞出来很容易？信使小姐，我这几个月勤勤恳恳在伦蒂尼姆拉拢的人手，大半都折在这破工厂里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......你最好别让我亏太大。请问，现在能走了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要再清点一下人数......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，南面厂房里的人都逃出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我说，人真的有点太多了。我接受的任务可只有接你一个。记得跟凯尔希说，答应我的报酬要翻倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，带上你的那个兜帽怪物，我们是时候——呃，你们愣着做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐，前面的路是你炸的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不然呢？给我们的追兵留机会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，费斯特先生和他的小队刚刚离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他们去救人了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔，联系他们。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......都那么大的人了，怎么还会乱跑啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G1_interrogat_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莱克，前面情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解。继续前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角，左边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"深......深池......我要杀了你们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，最终杀死你的并不是深池。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又一个？这一路上倒了多少萨卡兹士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十六个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是深池干的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看样子是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角，我不知道该怎么说，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......深池帮我们省了不少力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承认这一点并不可耻。你跟着我在萨迪恩区躲了多久了，布莱克？想要活下去，我们就得利用一切可以利用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，下一个是左边这扇门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——准备好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角，是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。接下来去右边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗本，注意角落。我不希望敌人从走廊上冒出来给我们惊喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳咳......走开，魔族！我们......我们什么都不会说的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真没想到......哈哈......我们听到了战斗的声响，还看到了源石技艺的光......我还以为又是魔族想到了什么新的折磨人的办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们受苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还能站起来吗，士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵......很久没听到有人这么叫我们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么长官吗？你来做什么？你怎么有脸站在这里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你干什么啊？我们是来救你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救我的？救我出去干什么？再被你们骗一次，然后死在你们跟异族人一起谋划的下一个阴谋里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做梦去吧，“长官”！我们宁可死在这个审讯室里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗本，举起你的弩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......号角？你这是要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来不想浪费弹药。你知道的，我们的任何资源都很宝贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......他们是同胞，也曾是对维多利亚尽职尽责的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如死在这里是他们最后的愿望，那他们配得上我们的弩弹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的会杀了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会如愿死在这阴暗的房间里。伦蒂尼姆会将你遗忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到很多年后，这片老旧的厂房不再能引起任何人的兴趣，腐烂的尘土会将你的白骨彻底掩藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你可以用我手上这把弩干点别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拿上它，跟我们一块从这里出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你或许还是能达成心愿，很快就死在敌人的炮火下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在临死前，你还来得及看一眼夜空，闻一闻充满了铁锈味和机油味的空气——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便想一想那些呼吸着同样空气的，你最希望能活下去的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会记住你的付出。我会用我的生命担保这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......是啊......他们可能还活着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想好了吗？没有多少犹豫的时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被俘的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我武器，我跟你走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人呢？你们也愿意跟我们走吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。布莱克，你的小队多了七......嗯，九个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵们，在出去之前，告诉我你们的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，联系上自救军小队了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无人机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下啊......我好不容易才重启了这个无人机......和那一个构造还不太一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们处境很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士，你先带着其他平民出去，自救军三队的人会在外面接......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我留下来的地雷都被引爆了！你知道这意味着什么吗？？你能想象一下有多少士兵在追我们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了我的人，你们是不是还想逼我掏光炸药的存货啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"五分钟。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们不能再耽搁了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我们最多再等五分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，麻烦你尽快联络上费斯特先生。他和洛洛小姐还有五分钟可以赶回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们也得投入战斗了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G1_interrogat_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老比尔，实话告诉我，你......你是不是变重了？我怎么拖得这么费力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......这样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还真轻了一点儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么你新学的戏法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么呢，老弟，我只是......只是换了个姿势......咳咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别别别，别换姿势了，我怕你的伤变得更重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才我找到你的时候，看你流了那么多血，我真怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怕我死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......那帮魔族佬，哪有那本事！也就是给我......按一下......按......哎呦......可真疼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就歇歇吧，别说话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你找到出路了吗？这些房间一定被萨卡兹改造过，绕得我头昏眼花的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，就在几分钟前，我听到了战斗的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想出口应该就在这附近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了老比尔，你还是说点什么吧，我真怕你就这样睡过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次打了胜仗，你问我要了什么奖励，你还记得吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......水果罐头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么水果罐头，你这家伙，你说你要一个机器小磐蟹，下次见面的时候送给你那住在金融街的大侄女！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对对，我就是饿晕了......多亏你记性好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么记性好？那之后我可是好几天没睡觉，除了出任务就是给你做那玩意儿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易快做完了，你可得给我挺着，等回去了就赶紧拿走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......好......都听你的，队长。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有脚步声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，队长，萨卡兹——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们往哪里走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到了吗？地上有血。他们走不远。追上去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须赶紧走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我和你一块扶着比尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战士比尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要让你们俩一起架着才能走，我可真丢人啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说这种话。比尔，你说的，我们是一家人。家人本来就应该互相帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长！他们追上来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"强尼，尽量挡一会！加比，我给你的小榴弹，你都带着吧？看准了就丢，我们需要点掩护——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，你让洛克十七继续在前面找路，我们能不能跑掉，全靠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"右转，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，右边走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......刚才是谁在说话？洛克十七？你......你怎么活了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是什么弱智工程师笑话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我费了好大功夫才黑进了这个无人机的系统......别误会，洛洛小姐，我没加什么料啊，完全是因为这个系统做得太简单了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可露希尔小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对对对，是我，我没机会给你的无人机装我的语音素材，所以只能靠电子元件来模拟发声了......唉，是不是没那么可爱啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......挺像你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们接下来怎么走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左转......不不不，左边有萨卡兹，呃，我是说敌方萨卡兹！你们快往后——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后面敌人更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那我想想办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了对了，我们往上，往上走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，你们不是有会飞的那种装置吗？滑索，我是说滑索！你们上方有个通风口，应该够一个人通过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是应该吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐，我们有重伤员，要是出了错，我们一个都走不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我需要洛洛小姐帮我控制下无人机......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说吧，我该怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛你......你这么相信她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，或者你说吧，你有什么更好的脱困方法吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长！他们马上就要过来了！我看到带头的萨卡兹了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，可露希尔小姐，洛洛，打开通风口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解！洛洛小姐，快瞄准！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛克十七——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？打开了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再来一轮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛克......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无人机失准！这......隔得这么远，这一剑也能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到此刻才找到离开的路吗？有些迟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我拦着，你快走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盲目的勇气在战场上并不能发挥任何作用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"强尼！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，通风口——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我没有办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我来想办法，我还有两颗榴弹，就算是皮糙肉厚的萨卡兹也......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？直接......劈开了榴弹？根本没有炸开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，这不是普通萨卡兹——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加比！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，我只不过是一名平平无奇的雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这种程度的话......你们真的想战胜曼弗雷德，甚至特雷西斯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差太远了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹......你以为，我做的只有几颗榴弹吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的只有几枚会冒烟的小道具，甚至连真正的榴弹都称不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能炸开萨卡兹身体的炸弹，可不会长成这副样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十七","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，洛洛，听得到吗？我帮你们重新校准了......但只有一次机会......抓紧啊，拜托啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成功了！队长，我们能上去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你带着比尔，你先走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹，你别想追上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会保护我的家人，你......你们别想再伤害他们，我不会让你得逞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛克十七！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无人机自爆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是......太微不足道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长......走......快走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，你告诉我，为了救一个战友，搭上两个......甚至可能更多战友的性命，这样的交换当真合理吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们临死前，呼唤的最后一个人，都是队长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你是否能背负起他们的牺牲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我宁可他们一个都不要死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，抓紧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再次利用了滑索？很聪明，但是，还不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些小伎俩......还并不足以让你们在战场上活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们马上就会再见面的，不成熟的反抗军战士。你们不知道......你们根本不可能活着离开这座炼狱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，他们来了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——四分五十秒过去了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我帮你们倒数吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅小姐！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，费斯特先生，只有你们三个吗？其他两位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们回不来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅小姐，我们必须马上离开这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个萨卡兹追过来了，他很厉害，而且他们人很多，我们......我们被埋伏了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了可露希尔小姐，否则我们一个都回不来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们知道我们会去，他们也知道你们在这里，他们只是在等......这的确是个陷阱，我们再不走就来不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，已经来不及了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，这是最后一个雷，也是最大的那一个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"又是最后一个？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这是第几个最后一个？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别烦我，{@nickname}，是的，我还有一个炸弹，你猜猜那是留给谁的？不用客气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你很紧张？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"来的人很难对付？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你没听出来这爆炸的声音一点都不对劲？啊，我知道了，你头上的布罐头底下根本就是空空如也。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你讲个萨卡兹鬼故事吧，那家伙根本没有踩进我的陷阱。他不仅避开了，而且还巧妙地破坏了它们的源石结构。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我再给你解释一下吗？是的，布置这批地雷并没有花掉我太多心思——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，上一次做到让我的雷全部哑火的人，是那个惹人厌的龙女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉不可能在这里，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小兔子，你那是什么表情？她不是应该在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，{@nickname}，你和凯尔希......真的该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该恭喜你，{@nickname}，就在刚刚，我决定让你在我的待炸名单上排第二了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这可不是好消息。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"谢谢。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐，我们还有许多信息没有同步。我们得先撤退......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......撤退？说得容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庆幸吧，来的人不是塔露拉，我没有闻到那股德拉克火焰特有的自大的臭味。但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"围住这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——八队九队，去墙另一边！封住那条路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么短的时间内就集结了这么多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，博士，海蒂女士他们还没撤走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，阿米娅小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，先不要说这些。要说的话，我们也要等安全地回去以后再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，等一会我来......欸欸，W小姐，你、你抓着我干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，你得留着点力气。你看看还在这里的人，工匠，伤员，废物......还有哪个有战斗力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......这么说也没错，但我们会尽力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不......咳咳......不拖后腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别了，我腿上这点肉还不够你们扯的。省点力气在逃跑上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......我真的很不想说这句话。这完全不是我的作风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我需要那个海蒂活着。我得找到那个老女人，问清楚一些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，你得让开了。带走你该带的人，别留下任何不可燃垃圾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要出事。我们会等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不走？是想让我用炸弹再送你们一程？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......终于走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽说些奇怪的话，搞得像我们真是什么亲密战友似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还要我继续炸下去吗？很快，这舞台就要不剩下什么了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这是什么玩意儿？石子？你在开什么劣质玩笑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜你，你惹到我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......我本来还想节俭一些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，干脆点走出来，我顺便答应让你的尸体完整一些，不好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，好险，你距离砍中我也就只差两颗炸弹的尺寸了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又成长了不少，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......怎么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会是你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
